Building of Miraikan Miraikan

Let’s begin our journey from Miraikan in Tokyo, Japan, to explore the Internet using a Hands-On Model of the Internet!!

In the Hands-On Model, the Internet consists of five nodes (A~E) in 4 LANs (Local Area Networks) and five terminal routers (small towers) that each node connects to, and five network routers (tall towers) that connect between LANs.

